WEBVTT

00:16.680 --> 00:20.280
<b>Touku o miteru sono manazashi wa</b>

00:20.280 --> 00:23.950
<b>Kokoro no naka no koe o kiiteru</b>

00:23.950 --> 00:28.120
<b>Mada aoi tsuki o dakishimete</b>

00:31.160 --> 00:34.830
<b>Hashiri-tsuzukeru kimi no tsuyosa ga</b>

00:34.830 --> 00:38.470
<b>Mata atarashii tobira o hiraku</b>

00:38.470 --> 00:42.670
<b>Sugu akeru yoru o terashidase</b>

00:45.670 --> 00:53.050
<b>Tatoe hitori de mo kimi no
koto shinjite itai</b>

00:53.050 --> 01:00.290
<b>Sonna shunkan ni kono
sekai wa ugokidasu</b>

01:00.290 --> 01:03.930
<b>Nani o mitsukete yukou</b>

01:03.930 --> 01:07.560
<b>Kokoro o hakidashite</b>

01:07.560 --> 01:14.330
<b>Mata koko de aeru yo
sore ga shinjitsu nara</b>

01:14.700 --> 01:18.410
<b>Nani o mitsumete iyou</b>

01:18.410 --> 01:25.210
<b>Kono te o sashidashite
tsukanda genjitsu o</b>

01:25.210 --> 01:28.880
<b>Let it go, shinjiyou</b>

01:36.090 --> 01:37.590
<b>Sanzo!</b>

01:37.590 --> 01:40.130
<b>Sanzo! Sanzo!</b>

01:40.130 --> 01:42.430
<b>You mustn't move him, Goku!</b>

01:42.430 --> 01:43.900
<b>Sanzo!</b>

01:44.500 --> 01:46.230
<b>I...</b>

01:46.230 --> 01:48.230
<b>I did this to Kouryuu with
my own hands.</b>

02:03.990 --> 02:07.610
<b>A Twilight Farewell</b>

02:08.820 --> 02:12.060
<b>No! Don't erase me!
Please don't erase me!</b>

02:12.730 --> 02:14.560
<b>Serves you right!</b>

02:14.560 --> 02:19.660
<b>Human or not, anyone who sides
with demons deserves to die!</b>

02:25.110 --> 02:26.440
<b>Hey, Goku.</b>

02:26.440 --> 02:26.610
<b>What's the matter, Goku?!
Hey, Goku.</b>

02:26.610 --> 02:27.910
<b>What's the matter, Goku?!</b>

02:35.750 --> 02:36.990
<b>Who are you?</b>

02:36.990 --> 02:37.250
<b>Goku!
Who are you?</b>

02:37.250 --> 02:37.920
<b>Goku!</b>

02:37.920 --> 02:38.490
<b>Goku!
Please get a hold of yourself!</b>

02:38.490 --> 02:39.380
<b>Please get a hold of yourself!</b>

02:40.160 --> 02:41.590
<b>Who is this guy?</b>

02:50.800 --> 02:52.430
<b>His demon power Limiter!</b>

02:52.430 --> 02:53.900
<b>It broke off!</b>

03:03.080 --> 03:03.910
<b>Goku!</b>

03:03.910 --> 03:04.580
<b>Gojyo, get back!
Goku!</b>

03:04.580 --> 03:05.380
<b>Gojyo, get back!</b>

03:10.150 --> 03:11.650
<b>Goku! Is that...</b>

03:11.650 --> 03:17.930
<b>Yes, his natural form has been
released from the Limiter's seal.</b>

03:17.930 --> 03:20.030
<b>A heathen Life form,</b>

03:20.030 --> 03:22.720
<b>conceived in a giant stone where
earthly auras gathered.</b>

03:24.830 --> 03:27.430
<b>Seiten Taisei , Son Goku!</b>

03:29.370 --> 03:31.910
<b>So that's your true form?!</b>

03:31.910 --> 03:34.930
<b>It seems you guys are
demons after all!</b>

03:39.150 --> 03:40.020
<b>He's fast!</b>

03:40.020 --> 03:40.620
<b>Goku!
He's fast!</b>

03:40.620 --> 03:41.480
<b>Goku!</b>

03:51.860 --> 03:53.330
<b>Damn it!</b>

03:54.230 --> 03:57.390
<b>What?! His demonic power burned
through the talismans?!</b>

04:11.650 --> 04:13.250
<b>You've got to be kidding me.</b>

04:13.250 --> 04:15.380
<b>I'd heard the stories from Sanzo,</b>

04:15.380 --> 04:18.050
<b>but I had no idea he'd go
totally crazy like this.</b>

04:18.050 --> 04:20.420
<b>This is no time to be impressed!</b>

04:20.420 --> 04:22.620
<b>Sanzo's still alive!</b>

04:24.390 --> 04:26.800
<b>The rain's robbing him
of his body heat.</b>

04:26.800 --> 04:28.290
<b>I have to at least stop the bleeding.</b>

04:29.200 --> 04:32.100
<b>We might be lucky, since
it missed the vital points.</b>

04:32.100 --> 04:33.570
<b>Missed the vital points?!</b>

04:34.200 --> 04:37.190
<b>That means there's still an
unconscious part in him that's...</b>

04:38.070 --> 04:40.180
<b>I'II take care of Sanzo somehow.</b>

04:40.180 --> 04:42.410
<b>Gojyo, please stop Goku!</b>

04:45.210 --> 04:48.080
<b>Sure, but how the hell am I
supposed to do that?</b>

04:48.080 --> 04:50.550
<b>I don't know either!
Only Sanzo would...</b>

04:51.220 --> 04:55.720
<b>But at this rate he won't be able to
suppress his incredible powers,</b>

04:55.720 --> 04:58.320
<b>and he'll continue to run wild until
he's destroyed everything!</b>

05:12.870 --> 05:14.360
<b>What the? The prayer beads...</b>

05:21.020 --> 05:22.480
<b>He ran away!</b>

05:24.690 --> 05:28.320
<b>I'm not running! I'll eturn without faill!</b>

05:28.320 --> 05:31.860
<b>And when I do, all of you,
all of you demons,</b>

05:31.860 --> 05:34.450
<b>will nurture my talisman!</b>

05:35.430 --> 05:38.990
<b>That's true. I'm sure he'll appear again.</b>

05:39.830 --> 05:43.460
<b>As long as he can't escape the
control of that talisman...</b>

05:44.770 --> 05:47.780
<b>I was able to close Sanzo's wound,</b>

05:47.780 --> 05:49.240
<b>so the only remaining problem is...</b>

05:51.050 --> 05:52.610
<b>Goku...</b>

05:52.610 --> 05:54.080
<b>Hey, you okay?</b>

05:56.720 --> 06:00.390
<b>No good! Goku can't discriminate
between friend and foe right now!</b>

06:00.390 --> 06:01.860
<b>Son of a...</b>

06:03.830 --> 06:05.450
<b>Damn it! He's strong!</b>

06:06.930 --> 06:08.530
<b>Eat this!</b>

06:08.530 --> 06:10.000
<b>Gojyo!</b>

06:11.730 --> 06:14.100
<b>Wake up, you stupid monkey!</b>

06:16.470 --> 06:17.410
<b>Damn it!</b>

06:17.410 --> 06:17.970
<b>Hold him there.
Damn it!</b>

06:17.970 --> 06:19.110
<b>Hold him there.</b>

06:19.110 --> 06:20.570
<b>What the hell?!</b>

06:38.730 --> 06:40.190
<b>Goku!</b>

06:42.430 --> 06:43.330
<b>He's asleep.</b>

06:44.270 --> 06:46.500
<b>But, what in the world was that?</b>

06:48.000 --> 06:50.700
<b>Really, you guys are pitiful.</b>

06:55.080 --> 06:55.840
<b>Yo!</b>

06:55.840 --> 06:56.580
<b>Who on Earth are you?
Yo!</b>

06:56.580 --> 06:57.740
<b>Who on Earth are you?</b>

07:02.050 --> 07:03.480
<b>Damn it!</b>

07:04.250 --> 07:09.490
<b>Who the hell is that brat?
Son of a bitch! How dare he...</b>

07:10.560 --> 07:14.650
<b>I've lost everything.
I have nothing Ieft.</b>

07:20.070 --> 07:23.970
<b>I'll kill them! I'll kill every
last one of them!</b>

07:31.080 --> 07:36.180
<b>You're not so hot if you're already
getting stalled here.</b>

07:36.180 --> 07:38.120
<b>Who the hell are you?</b>

07:38.120 --> 07:40.560
<b>Hey, you, watch what you say!</b>

07:40.560 --> 07:44.460
<b>This lady's one of the Five Great
Boddhisattvas who rule the Heavens.</b>

07:44.460 --> 07:48.690
<b>The embodiment of benevolence
and mercy, the Merciful Goddess!</b>

07:50.130 --> 07:52.530
<b>The Merciful Goddess? Her?!</b>

07:52.530 --> 07:58.140
<b>Oh, then might it be you who put
Goku's limiter back on him?</b>

07:58.140 --> 08:00.640
<b>Yes, that little runt's coronet</b>

08:00.640 --> 08:04.480
<b>is totally different from those
that are commonly used.</b>

08:04.480 --> 08:06.210
<b>It's made of no ordinary materials.</b>

08:06.210 --> 08:08.780
<b>It's a special coronet made of
great divine power solidified</b>

08:08.780 --> 08:12.990
<b>which only the Gods are
capable of creating.</b>

08:12.990 --> 08:17.550
<b>In short, that's just how far off the
scale Son Goku's powers are.</b>

08:18.260 --> 08:21.700
<b>Now, he's the only problem left.</b>

08:21.700 --> 08:23.820
<b>He's been worked over pretty good.</b>

08:24.570 --> 08:28.970
<b>I closed the wound, but he
lost quite a bit of blood,</b>

08:28.970 --> 08:30.140
<b>and that's beyond my abilities.</b>

08:30.140 --> 08:30.470
<b>Leave it to me.
and that's beyond my abilities.</b>

08:30.470 --> 08:31.560
<b>Leave it to me.</b>

08:32.540 --> 08:35.010
<b>The word impossible
doesn't exist for me!</b>

08:35.010 --> 08:37.950
<b>Are all the Gods like her?
After all , I'm the Merciful Goddess!</b>

08:37.950 --> 08:40.080
<b>Oh, no, not necessarily...</b>

08:40.080 --> 08:43.820
<b>Right! You there with long hair, who
looks like you have a lot of blood!</b>

08:43.820 --> 08:45.050
<b>Get your butt over here.</b>

08:45.050 --> 08:45.350
<b>The hell you say?!
Get your butt over here.</b>

08:45.350 --> 08:46.550
<b>The hell you say?!</b>

08:46.550 --> 08:49.460
<b>Hey, I don't care if you're a goddess!</b>

08:49.460 --> 08:50.920
<b>Who died and made you boss?!</b>

08:55.800 --> 08:57.800
<b>Well , I guess that'll do.</b>

08:57.800 --> 08:59.930
<b>But hey, you seem like
you've done this a lot.</b>

08:59.930 --> 09:01.600
<b>Hey, what's the big idea?</b>

09:03.910 --> 09:04.970
<b>Gojyo!</b>

09:04.970 --> 09:05.370
<b>Gojyo!
You're going to get sick if you
move around too much,</b>

09:05.370 --> 09:07.810
<b>You're going to get sick if you
move around too much,</b>

09:07.810 --> 09:11.850
<b>because I sucked out a lot
of your blood just now.</b>

09:11.850 --> 09:14.410
<b>Say that before you do it.</b>

09:16.850 --> 09:20.480
<b>I bet you'll hate having this done
to you, Konzen Douji.</b>

09:21.060 --> 09:23.890
<b>No, you're Genjo Sanzo now,
aren't you?</b>

09:24.860 --> 09:29.320
<b>If you don't like it, then try making it
through on your own.</b>

09:39.210 --> 09:40.670
<b>Sanzo, you're awake!</b>

09:41.480 --> 09:44.570
<b>No, he probably swatted
at me unconsciously.</b>

09:45.250 --> 09:47.840
<b>You really are a cute kid.</b>

09:48.680 --> 09:51.810
<b>Anyway, now there's no need
for the transfusion.</b>

09:52.890 --> 09:54.350
<b>Thank you very much.</b>

09:55.860 --> 09:58.390
<b>If you want to thank me, pay me
back with your body.</b>

09:58.390 --> 10:02.230
<b>I didn't help you out of good will
or a sense of morality.</b>

10:02.860 --> 10:05.170
<b>The true purpose of your journey</b>

10:05.170 --> 10:08.230
<b>is to stop the experiments
to revive Gyumaoh.</b>

10:08.940 --> 10:13.530
<b>To be honest, it'd be no fun
if you guys died now.</b>

10:14.440 --> 10:15.910
<b>Well, see you later.</b>

10:19.580 --> 10:23.910
<b>Show me this ragtag thing
you put together.</b>

10:24.590 --> 10:27.320
<b>Show me how far it'll go.</b>

10:34.630 --> 10:36.860
<b>Goku, I thought I might find you here.</b>

10:37.900 --> 10:40.970
<b>It doesn't look like Sanzo will
wake up anytime soon,</b>

10:40.970 --> 10:42.940
<b>so why don't you at least eat a little?</b>

10:42.940 --> 10:44.600
<b>It's okay. I'm going to stay here.</b>

10:45.270 --> 10:50.950
<b>You don't remember what happened
while your limiter was off, do you?</b>

10:50.950 --> 10:56.020
<b>No, I was watching the blood gushing
out of Sanzo's stomach,</b>

10:56.020 --> 10:59.220
<b>then everything suddenly went white,</b>

10:59.220 --> 11:02.820
<b>and all sorts of things went round
and round in my head.</b>

11:02.820 --> 11:05.790
<b>Come to think of it, I wonder
who that was?</b>

11:05.790 --> 11:08.390
<b>The way he looked at me was really
familiar, sort of like Sanzo.</b>

11:09.860 --> 11:13.430
<b>I don't have any memory
of my past at all.</b>

11:13.430 --> 11:16.870
<b>No memories from before I was
locked away in Mount Gogyou.</b>

11:16.870 --> 11:20.310
<b>I guess I'd done something
really awful.</b>

11:20.310 --> 11:22.880
<b>I was chained inside a craggy prison,</b>

11:22.880 --> 11:26.010
<b>and I'd been watching the sky
for years and years.</b>

11:26.010 --> 11:27.850
<b>When I was finally saved,</b>

11:27.850 --> 11:29.680
<b>a golden light reached out to me.</b>

11:29.680 --> 11:33.120
<b>The golden light of the sun I had
longed for all that time.</b>

11:33.120 --> 11:36.320
<b>I 'm always being saved by Sanzo,</b>

11:36.320 --> 11:40.060
<b>even though I can't do
anything for him.</b>

11:40.060 --> 11:43.030
<b>But if you want to be there
for someone,</b>

11:43.030 --> 11:45.290
<b>I think the first thing to do
is not to let them down.</b>

11:47.570 --> 11:52.470
<b>Remember what Sanzo said?
That these guys won't die.</b>

11:52.470 --> 11:56.410
<b>So,we must live up
to that expectation,</b>

11:56.410 --> 11:58.380
<b>using everything in our
power to do so.</b>

11:59.410 --> 12:01.050
<b>I see.</b>

12:01.050 --> 12:02.980
<b>Okay! I 'll become stronger!</b>

12:07.720 --> 12:12.160
<b>So at the very least, I won't die
miserably in front of these guys.</b>

12:12.960 --> 12:16.130
<b>Now, I'm hungry. How about you?</b>

12:16.130 --> 12:19.000
<b>Since Gojyo's down for the count
with his anemia,</b>

12:19.000 --> 12:21.900
<b>perhaps I'll cook something
healthy for everyone.</b>

12:21.900 --> 12:25.140
<b>What? You're going to cook? All right!</b>

12:25.140 --> 12:27.200
<b>I'll go ask if we can borrow
the kitchen.</b>

12:28.440 --> 12:33.680
<b>Really, you're the only person who
could get Goku that depressed.</b>

12:34.720 --> 12:38.750
<b>In any case, please don't do
anything that might reopen</b>

12:38.750 --> 12:40.660
<b>the wound we worked
so hard to close.</b>

12:40.660 --> 12:43.450
<b>I don't want matching scars.</b>

12:55.370 --> 12:56.840
<b>This is stupid.</b>

13:04.050 --> 13:05.480
<b>Damn...</b>

13:06.410 --> 13:07.940
<b>Hey, droopy-eyes...</b>

13:09.680 --> 13:13.820
<b>If you want to go out alone, feel free
to use the window over there.</b>

13:13.820 --> 13:17.350
<b>I'm technically here to keep
an eye on you, so...</b>

13:19.790 --> 13:23.320
<b>It's your problem, right? It's not
our place to stop you.</b>

13:23.970 --> 13:27.670
<b>Sheesh, you're all such busy bodies.</b>

13:27.670 --> 13:29.340
<b>What a heartless thing to say</b>

13:29.340 --> 13:31.310
<b>and after sharing an indirect kiss too.</b>

13:32.740 --> 13:35.310
<b>Well , anyway, that was a joke.</b>

13:35.310 --> 13:39.280
<b>The prayer beads around Rikudo's
neck... They're yours, right?</b>

13:39.280 --> 13:40.880
<b>So what if they are?</b>

13:40.880 --> 13:42.450
<b>I thought so.</b>

13:42.450 --> 13:45.280
<b>They lit up, like they were
trying to protect that guy.</b>

13:46.920 --> 13:51.090
<b>Possessed by that talisman, those
prayer beads are probably</b>

13:51.090 --> 13:53.490
<b>the last thing that's keeping
Rikudo's spirit together.</b>

13:53.490 --> 13:56.900
<b>When the prayer beads fail before
the power of the talisman,</b>

13:56.900 --> 13:58.600
<b>he'll...</b>

13:58.600 --> 14:02.000
<b>Well , I don't really care
what happens to you,</b>

14:02.000 --> 14:05.340
<b>but there are two that get real
riled up over this stuff, so...</b>

14:05.340 --> 14:07.600
<b>You're quite the popular gu,
Master Sanzo.</b>

14:09.240 --> 14:10.900
<b>You just keep shooting
your mouth off.</b>

14:11.710 --> 14:13.180
<b>See you later.</b>

14:24.790 --> 14:27.330
<b>The prayer beads are responding
to something,</b>

14:27.330 --> 14:29.400
<b>as though they're being
drawn somewhere.</b>

14:29.400 --> 14:31.130
<b>Someone's calling!</b>

14:31.130 --> 14:32.600
<b>With a voice I know well!</b>

14:34.740 --> 14:36.200
<b>This aura is...</b>

14:45.710 --> 14:47.250
<b>Kouryuu...</b>

14:47.250 --> 14:49.980
<b>Alive...  You're alive?!</b>

14:50.520 --> 14:53.510
<b>Did you come crawling out here
to get killed by yourself?</b>

14:54.290 --> 14:57.520
<b>No, I came to kill you
with my own hands.</b>

14:58.160 --> 14:59.630
<b>Thought as much.</b>

15:00.190 --> 15:02.130
<b>Here, take it. I want you to have it.</b>

15:02.700 --> 15:04.570
<b>It's a very rare item.</b>

15:04.570 --> 15:06.660
<b>How very like you, Kouryuu.</b>

15:08.900 --> 15:11.870
<b>Now, try and kill me if you can!</b>

15:15.340 --> 15:19.680
<b>I'll teach you the suffering this
body of mine went through!</b>

15:19.680 --> 15:24.170
<b>My fate was warped because
you left the temple!</b>

15:34.600 --> 15:37.930
<b>Your movements are slow
for all your talk.</b>

15:39.570 --> 15:43.240
<b>Your favorite banishing talismans
won't work on me.</b>

15:43.240 --> 15:44.700
<b>Too bad.</b>

15:47.740 --> 15:49.940
<b>I just figured it out.</b>

15:49.940 --> 15:52.540
<b>I know what this body wants now.</b>

15:53.680 --> 15:56.170
<b>It's your life, Kouryuu!</b>

15:57.280 --> 15:59.890
<b>Your aim's off too, you know.</b>

15:59.890 --> 16:02.410
<b>Maybe the wound you got when
I stabbed you is aching?</b>

16:04.960 --> 16:09.030
<b>That time, it wasn't Goku I
unconsciously tried to protect.</b>

16:09.030 --> 16:10.930
<b>A deep scar within me...</b>

16:11.900 --> 16:14.130
<b>A pain that still hasn't vanished...</b>

16:15.270 --> 16:18.640
<b>I don't want matching scars.</b>

16:18.640 --> 16:22.980
<b>There are two who get real riled up
over this stuff, so...</b>

16:22.980 --> 16:25.510
<b>Okay! I 'll become stronger!</b>

16:25.510 --> 16:28.150
<b>Using everything that's
within my powers,</b>

16:28.150 --> 16:31.610
<b>I 'll live for my self and die
only for my self.</b>

16:32.620 --> 16:34.750
<b>Like hell I'll die for someone else!</b>

16:35.520 --> 16:39.030
<b>Because I know the pain of one
ho's been left behind.</b>

16:39.030 --> 16:40.520
<b>That's what I stake my pride on.</b>

16:42.500 --> 16:43.930
<b>That tantra is...</b>

16:52.610 --> 16:54.440
<b>Immobilizing Spiritual Binding!</b>

17:01.180 --> 17:03.480
<b>A paralyzing spell that works against
both humans and spirits!</b>

17:04.090 --> 17:05.550
<b>I can't move at all!</b>

17:08.160 --> 17:10.650
<b>I feel like I must be
dreaming , Kouryuu.</b>

17:12.090 --> 17:15.930
<b>I get to kill you like tearing
wings off a bird!</b>

17:17.470 --> 17:21.060
<b>Die and you'll become mine!
Your soul! Everything!</b>

17:21.740 --> 17:26.170
<b>We can experience the nightmare
you put me through together!</b>

17:26.170 --> 17:28.040
<b>Shut the hell up.</b>

17:28.040 --> 17:32.280
<b>Maybe it's my fault Kinzan
Temple was attacked,</b>

17:32.280 --> 17:35.450
<b>but you being controlled
by the talisman,</b>

17:35.450 --> 17:37.080
<b>that's because you were weak!</b>

17:38.350 --> 17:40.720
<b>Shut up! Shut up! Shut up!</b>

17:40.720 --> 17:43.590
<b>If only... If only you never existed!</b>

17:57.200 --> 17:59.140
<b>Shuei...</b>

17:59.140 --> 18:03.740
<b>The talisman of Araya's Spell
is consuming all that he is.</b>

18:03.740 --> 18:07.980
<b>Nothing will keep Shuei from
being totally consumed now.</b>

18:07.980 --> 18:09.450
<b>Nothing...</b>

18:10.550 --> 18:12.140
<b>Kouryuu...</b>

18:14.020 --> 18:17.930
<b>They all say you're like
a Shura or a Rasetsu,</b>

18:17.930 --> 18:21.900
<b>but I was thinking you look like
something far different to me.</b>

18:21.900 --> 18:23.800
<b>What's that?</b>

18:23.800 --> 18:25.560
<b>Well, what do you suppose?</b>

18:28.540 --> 18:31.410
<b>Kouryuu, if only you
had never existed,</b>

18:31.410 --> 18:33.570
<b>I could have lost my self sooner!</b>

18:35.240 --> 18:36.710
<b>Shuei...</b>

18:46.490 --> 18:48.150
<b>This is my will.</b>

18:49.520 --> 18:52.650
<b>I might not be able to believe in gods,
but I can believe in my self.</b>

18:53.330 --> 18:54.790
<b>How very like you.</b>

18:55.460 --> 18:56.930
<b>Here, take it.</b>

18:57.870 --> 19:02.800
<b>I've never given any one anything,
so it's a very rare item.</b>

19:12.410 --> 19:13.880
<b>Thank you.</b>

19:17.250 --> 19:21.590
<b>Oh, look, Kouryuu, the birds are
returning home to the North.</b>

19:23.820 --> 19:28.590
<b>Kouryuu, who do you suppose
decided that birds are free?</b>

19:29.460 --> 19:32.830
<b>Even if they can fly through
the sky as they please,</b>

19:32.830 --> 19:36.770
<b>if there's no journey's end or branch
to rest their wings on,</b>

19:36.770 --> 19:39.500
<b>they might even regret
that they have wings.</b>

19:40.740 --> 19:42.440
<b>True freedom...</b>

19:47.150 --> 19:51.950
<b>Perhaps true freedom is to have
somewhere to go home to.</b>

19:53.890 --> 19:55.860
<b>Mister, where to?</b>

19:55.860 --> 19:57.410
<b>Your first ride's 10,000 yen.</b>

20:03.530 --> 20:05.190
<b>West, where else?</b>

20:06.670 --> 20:09.970
<b>I'm sleeping. Any one who
wakes me up is dead.</b>

20:09.970 --> 20:11.960
<b>Yes, yes. Good night.</b>

20:15.210 --> 20:20.580
<b>And so, that ragtag thing will
always start moving again.</b>

20:20.580 --> 20:23.520
<b>They're a group who'd rather
bite their tongues and die</b>

20:23.520 --> 20:25.610
<b>before being forced to dance
to anyone else's tune.</b>

20:26.620 --> 20:29.050
<b>They haven't changed one bit
in five hundred years.</b>

20:29.790 --> 20:31.430
<b>No matter how many times they die...</b>

20:31.430 --> 20:33.360
<b>No matter how many times
they're reborn...</b>

20:37.500 --> 20:43.900
<b>Sou hito ga yosasou na
kao de yatte kuru</b>

20:43.900 --> 20:49.310
<b>Totsuzen na higeki mo
utagau koto wa naku</b>

20:49.310 --> 20:54.780
<b>Nagekigoto sezu damatta mama de</b>

20:54.780 --> 20:58.190
<b>Ue o miagerunda</b>

20:58.190 --> 21:03.990
<b>Donna arifureta shiin
mo enji-tsuzukeru</b>

21:03.990 --> 21:09.430
<b>Yume toka kibou toka iu mae ni sa</b>

21:09.430 --> 21:14.740
<b>Kitto dare ni totte mo
onaji koto darou</b>

21:14.740 --> 21:18.670
<b>You must fight against yourself</b>

21:25.680 --> 21:29.350
<b>The sun sets and a new day comes</b>

21:29.350 --> 21:31.290
<b>Repeating is one change</b>

21:31.290 --> 21:35.420
<b>Don't avert eyes from differences</b>

21:35.420 --> 21:39.560
<b>Your nerve and soul to the limit</b>

21:39.560 --> 21:42.230
<b>Go forward now</b>

21:42.230 --> 21:47.270
<b>Haritsumeta puresshaa tonariawase de</b>

21:47.270 --> 21:52.670
<b>Dare yori mo daitan futeki ni warau</b>

21:52.670 --> 21:58.110
<b>Kitto dare ni totte mo
onaji koto darou</b>

21:58.110 --> 22:02.140
<b>You must fight against yourself</b>

22:12.190 --> 22:13.520
<b>Next Saiyuki</b>

22:14.900 --> 22:16.830
<b>He's got a vague way of saying things.</b>

22:16.830 --> 22:19.170
<b>A nasty look, like a snake
that's found its prey.</b>

22:19.170 --> 22:22.270
<b>His attitude pisses me off. I can
only think he's picking a fight.</b>

22:22.270 --> 22:25.840
<b>Who the hell is this fortune-teller
named Chin Yisou?</b>

22:25.840 --> 22:28.430
<b>I don't really know, but I just get
the feeling he's dangerous.</b>

22:29.740 --> 22:31.880
<b>Next time on Gensou Maden Saiyuki:
''The Man Who Foretells Death''</b>

22:31.880 --> 22:34.150
<b>Next Time
The Man Who Foretells Death
Next time on Gensou Maden Saiyuki:
''The Man Who Foretells  Death''</b>

22:34.150 --> 22:35.650
<b>Next Time
The Man Who Foretells Death
You'd do well to watch!</b>
